@startuml state_machines_worker
!theme cyborg
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor #16324a
 BorderColor #4aa3df
 FontColor #e6edf7
 BackgroundColor<<terminal>> #3a1d22
 BorderColor<<terminal>> #e06c75
 BackgroundColor<<finding>> #3a2a12
 BorderColor<<finding>> #e5a50a
 BackgroundColor<<documented>> #273241
 BorderColor<<documented>> #61738a
 FontColor<<documented>> #b8c4d4
}
skinparam note {
 BackgroundColor #1b2330
 BorderColor #61738a
 FontColor #e6edf7
}
hide empty description
title COMMUNICATION worker: which activity runs, and where are Start, a setup request and a delivery seen?\n(implemented, integration 994ce24; communication.c runIdleCycle)
state "Boot\nstorage_init, wifi_init,\nloadServerProfile, loadRegistration" as Boot
state "Offline: thread ended\nState = OFFLINE" as Offline <<terminal>>
state Dispatch <<choice>>
state "Network activities: Start is checked at least every 200 ms;\nthe activity returns -ECANCELED and stops its own work" as Network {
  state "Boot join\nBootJoinIsPending = true\nBootAttemptsUsed ≤ 4, 5 s gap" as BootJoin
  state "Resume boot join\nBootJoinIsPending\n5 s delay, remaining attempts" as Resume
  state "Idle wait\nk_sem_take(ControlChanged)\n≤ 2 min or next transport duty;\n0 s while DeliveryIsPending" as IdleWait
  state "Idle pass, in this order:\nrunDelivery → recoverConnection →\ncloseIdleSecureConnection →\nprepareTransportInIdle → registerInIdle" as IdlePass
  state "Setup\nState = SETUP\n(see setup statechart)" as Setup
}
state "Listening\nListeningIsActive; stopWiFiWork();\nState = STOPPED = acknowledgement\nwait for a control event, no timeout" as Listening
state "Cleanup fault latched\nCleanupFaultIsLatched (until restart)\nonly runDelivery → terminal FAILED" as Fault <<terminal>>
[*] --> Boot
Boot --> Offline : wifi_init fails
Boot --> BootJoin : stored network valid
Boot --> Setup : no or invalid stored network
Network --> Dispatch : activity returns\n(joined, JOIN_FAILURE, setup closed,\nIdle pass done)
IdleWait --> IdlePass : semaphore or timeout\n[not listening]
IdlePass --> Setup : RECONNECT_FAILURE
Dispatch --> Listening : [ListeningIsActive]
Dispatch --> Fault : [CleanupFaultIsLatched]
Dispatch --> Setup : [SetupIsRequested]
Dispatch --> Resume : [BootJoinIsPending]
Dispatch --> IdleWait : [else]
Network --> Listening : Start observed
Listening --> Dispatch : Stop (an interrupted\nboot join resumes first)
Network --> Fault : a stop or cancel\nwithout proven release
Fault --> Listening : Start\n(acknowledged at once)
Listening --> Fault : Stop [latched]
note right of Network
 **Delivery is serviced only in the Idle pass and in the fault branch.**
 A job admitted while Boot join, Resume, link recovery inside the
 Idle pass or Setup runs keeps outcome PENDING past its P13 deadline:
 TICKET-222 (reproduced for setup, boot join and link recovery).
end note
note bottom of Dispatch
 Checked at the top of every pass after a non-blocking event check,
 in this priority: listening, fault, setup request, interrupted boot join.
 A consumed semaphore is not lost: flags and DeliveryIsPending are re-read.
end note
@enduml
